    "scopeBoundary": "Owns a specific added-location or capacity investment decision, not a generic growth-strategy list, business valuation or the accounting treatment of startup costs.",
    "opening": "A business expansion plan tests whether a specific addition can earn enough incremental contribution, fit delivery capacity and stay funded through the ramp. Compare the business with and without the addition, include displaced existing work and dated opening payments, then define evidence-based conditions for proceeding, revising or stopping.",
    "answerHtml": "<p>A business expansion plan tests whether a specific addition can earn enough incremental contribution, fit delivery capacity and stay funded through the ramp. Compare the business with and without the addition, include displaced existing work and dated opening payments, then define evidence-based conditions for proceeding, revising or stopping.</p>",
